Developer inspection commands

Usage: pudu debug [OPTIONS] [ARGS]...

Arguments:
  [ARGS]...  

Options:
  -C <PATH>         Change to this directory before running
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v, -vv)
      --no-network  Forbid all network access. (No effect until S3.)
  -h, --help        Print help
